{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/06/26/itm_3f91ad9095e357f4/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.25819","category_id":"llm-agent","collected_at":"2026-06-26T00:13:23Z","content_hash":"4f5ea778615f02d3d378f386cbdd851cf1e816ec86acf5b1ec9d613b315a35cb","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission history","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.25819"},{"label":"arXiv PDF","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.25819"},{"label":"ToolBench-X GitHub repository","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/Foreverskyou/ToolBench-X"},{"label":"StableToolBench related benchmark","type":"url","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2024.findings-acl.664/"},{"label":"PlanBench-XL related agent benchmark","type":"url","url":"https://planbench-xl.github.io/"}],"external_id":"arxiv:2606.25819v1","fetched_at":"2026-06-26T00:13:23Z","fingerprint":"4f5ea778615f02d3d378f386cbdd851cf1e816ec86acf5b1ec9d613b315a35cb","id":"itm_3f91ad9095e357f4","item_id":"itm_3f91ad9095e357f4","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-06-24T13:34:34Z","reading_minutes":18,"score":91,"sort_at":"2026-06-24T13:34:34Z","source_id":"arxiv-manual","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"ToolBench-X 将工具调用 Agent 的评测从函数选择和参数正确性扩展到不可靠工具环境中的任务完成能力：作者构造 1,106 个可执行多步任务，覆盖 7 个主题、84 个子主题和 sequential/parallel/mixture 三类 workflow，并从干净 Python 工具中注入 Specification Drift、Invocation Error、Execution Failure、Output Drift、Cross-source Conflict 五类可恢复 hazard。12 个模型主实验显示最佳整体准确率仅 0.513，没有模型超过 0.60；Invocation 是最难异常，Output 相对容易。200 题诊断子集表明 Hint 可提升 25.5 到 35.5 个百分点，而只增加推理轮次的 test-time scaling 只提升 3.5 到 11.5 个百分点，说明主要瓶颈是 hazard diagnosis 而不是算力。局限是代码和数据仓库当前仍处于整理状态、任务为构造分布且 exact-match 更适合单一 scalar 答案。","tags":["llm-agent","tool-use","benchmark","reliability","function-calling","agent-evaluation"],"title":"Beyond Function Calling: Benchmarking Tool-Using Agents under Tool-Environment Unreliability","title_hash":"6e6b0cd7cbaeb942d8640d1f63d0395f501f7b7fd0ac78a6eafdf298c614b45f","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.25819"}
